{"work_id":"tirumbippaar","target_language":"en","canonical_scene":52,"scene_status":"verified","unit_count":15,"units":[{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u001","kind":"stage-direction","status":"verified","source":{"page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":59}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(Punyakodi and several workers are having refreshments.)"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u002","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d001","speaker_label":"புண்யகோடி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":59}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(While eating.) You cannot find an upright leader like Paranthaman. For good conduct and honest behaviour, our Paranthaman alone is the one and only example."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u003","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d002","speaker_label":"தொழிலாளி ஒருவன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":59}]},"translation":{"english_text":"You're praising him, but your own son has written 'The False Leader.'"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u004","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d003","speaker_label":"புண்யகோடி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":59}]},"translation":{"english_text":"The boy writes—he's lost his sense. Is he my son? He's a traitor."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u005","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d004","speaker_label":"தொழிலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":59}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Keep quiet. Pandiyan is a great rationalist! A hero of ideals! A true servant!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u006","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d005","speaker_label":"புண்யகோடி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":59}]},"translation":{"english_text":"He... is a traitor!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u007","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d006","speaker_label":"தொழிலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":59}]},"translation":{"english_text":"They say they're even going to make a film called 'The False Leader.'"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u008","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d007","speaker_label":"புண்யகோடி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":67,"printed_page":59}]},"translation":{"english_text":"They will, they will! First this cinema itself must disappear. Reform, my foot! Widow remarriage. No child marriage. An old man getting married? All this is cinema. When will this cinema disappear?"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u009","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d008","speaker_label":"தொழிலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":60}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Why, is it attacking you personally?"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u010","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d009","speaker_label":"புண்யகோடி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":60}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Hey, why do labourers need motion pictures!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u011","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d010","speaker_label":"தொழிலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":60}]},"translation":{"english_text":"For a man who works hard all day, cinema gives a little relief. Would you deny even that small pleasure?"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u012","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d011","speaker_label":"புண்யகோடி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":60}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Oh, wonderful happiness! Let this power cut spread all over the world so that cinema itself disappears."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u013","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d012","speaker_label":"தொழிலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":60}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Look at that noble thought! For cinema to disappear, he says even rain must not fall and make the town prosper!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u014","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d013","speaker_label":"மற்றொரு தொழிலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":60}]},"translation":{"english_text":"When people grow old, they babble like this."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s052-u015","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s052-d014","speaker_label":"புண்யகோடி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":68,"printed_page":60}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Who's old, eh?... I'll knock your teeth out. These fellows all seem to belong to Pandiyan's group. He said the same thing. Old, am I? Old age! This is a head anointed with Palani panchamirtham."}}]}